\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Agri-AMoE 3D occupancy decoder. The 2D BEV tokens are lifted into a 3D volume and first enhanced by channel attention. The enhanced features are fed in parallel to three anisotropic experts and are also used to generate spatial saliency and gradient energy along three directions for voxel-wise routing weights. The three expert outputs are combined by weighted summation and residual fusion before final classification.}}{9}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:agri-amoe}{{5}{9}{Agri-AMoE 3D occupancy decoder. The 2D BEV tokens are lifted into a 3D volume and first enhanced by channel attention. The enhanced features are fed in parallel to three anisotropic experts and are also used to generate spatial saliency and gradient energy along three directions for voxel-wise routing weights. The three expert outputs are combined by weighted summation and residual fusion before final classification}{figure.5}{}}
