\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces 3D visualization of crop-row fitting and navigation centerlines. The three columns show the current forward-facing RGB image, fitting results from semantic occupancy labels, and fitting results from AgriOcc occupancy predictions. Magenta lines denote fitted crop rows, and blue lines denote navigation centerlines between adjacent crop rows. All occupancy views share the same viewpoint, coordinate range, and semantic colors. For visibility, the overlaid lines are displayed above the crop canopy. The blue centerlines serve as inter-row geometric references and have not undergone traversability checks.}}{16}{figure.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:crop_row_3d_rgb}{{9}{16}{3D visualization of crop-row fitting and navigation centerlines. The three columns show the current forward-facing RGB image, fitting results from semantic occupancy labels, and fitting results from AgriOcc occupancy predictions. Magenta lines denote fitted crop rows, and blue lines denote navigation centerlines between adjacent crop rows. All occupancy views share the same viewpoint, coordinate range, and semantic colors. For visibility, the overlaid lines are displayed above the crop canopy. The blue centerlines serve as inter-row geometric references and have not undergone traversability checks}{figure.9}{}}
